			<div class="grid grid-margin">
				<div class="grid-cell -4of12 -6of12-md -12of12-sm">
					<p class="align-center mt0 mb10">困った時は、まずはこちら</p>
					<a class="o-btn o-btn--outline o-btn--block u-fs" href="/faq/" vlpageid="inq4_a1">よくあるご質問</a>
				</div>
				<div class="grid-cell -4of12 -6of12-md -12of12-sm">
